{"about_the_game":"Welcome a new member of C.A.S.T. (CHERNOZEM ANOMALY STRIKE TEAM)<br><br>Dive into an alternate 1950s Europe in this co-op third-person extraction shooter. Combining advanced technology with a nostalgic twist, your squad will confront monstrous threats and anomalies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140620/extras/cast_gif_0.gif?t=1750842037\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140620/extras/join_forces.png?t=1750842037\" /></div><br>Whether playing solo or in co-op (1-4 players), experience dynamic gameplay with unique objectives and challenging side tasks. Your success relies on precise teamwork and strategy.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140620/extras/explore.png?t=1750842037\" /></div><br>Venture through handcrafted maps enhanced with procedural elements and varied weather conditions. Each map features distinct objectives and random anomalies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140620/extras/custom_1.png?t=1750842037\" /></div><br>Equip a wide array of ranged and melee weapons, each with upgrade options. Create and refine your loadout with unique modifiers, and utilize the crafting workshop to enhance your existing gear and craft new ones.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140620/extras/confort.png?t=1750842037\" /></div><br>Face off against a variety of distinct enemies, each with their own strengths and tactics. Adapt your strategies to survive their attacks.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140620/extras/cast_gif_1.gif?t=1750842037\" /></div>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Exterminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140620/44a1e761b62d24e6f4ed1e2a80ad6b15ec8c5c65.jpg"},{"name":"Exterminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140620/44a1e761b62d24e6f4ed1e2a80ad6b15ec8c5c65.jpg"},{"name":"Exterminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140620/44a1e761b62d24e6f4ed1e2a80ad6b15ec8c5c65.jpg"},{"name":"Sergeant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140620/44a1e761b62d24e6f4ed1e2a80ad6b15ec8c5c65.jpg"},{"name":"Reanimated Soldier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140620/44a1e761b62d24e6f4ed1e2a80ad6b15ec8c5c65.jpg"},{"name":"Guard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140620/44a1e761b62d24e6f4ed1e2a80ad6b15ec8c5c65.jpg"},{"name":"First difficulty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140620/44a1e761b62d24e6f4ed1e2a80ad6b15ec8c5c65.jpg"},{"name":"Second difficulty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140620/44a1e761b62d24e6f4ed1e2a80ad6b15ec8c5c65.jpg"},{"name":"Third difficulty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140620/44a1e761b62d24e6f4ed1e2a80ad6b15ec8c5c65.jpg"},{"name":"Fourth difficulty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140620/44a1e761b62d24e6f4ed1e2a80ad6b15ec8c5c65.jpg"}],"total":69},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3140620?t=1750842037","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750842037","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140620/ab9576d164e78bcae4be8f5cee8ca4acc0aed594/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_3.jpg?t=1750842037","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140620/ab9576d164e78bcae4be8f5cee8ca4acc0aed594/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_3.jpg?t=1750842037","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Gameplay revolves around frequent combat scenarios where characters use their weapons to defeat monsters."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140620/extras/7c38f3f5ca8d1d49ea5b4337ccea97e9.avif?t=1750842037\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Welcome a new member of C.A.S.T. (CHERNOZEM ANOMALY STRIKE TEAM)<br><br>Dive into an alternate 1950s Europe in this co-op third-person extraction shooter. Combining advanced technology with a nostalgic twist, your squad will confront monstrous threats and anomalies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140620/extras/cast_gif_0.gif?t=1750842037\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140620/extras/join_forces.png?t=1750842037\" /></div><br>Whether playing solo or in co-op (1-4 players), experience dynamic gameplay with unique objectives and challenging side tasks. Your success relies on precise teamwork and strategy.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140620/extras/explore.png?t=1750842037\" /></div><br>Venture through handcrafted maps enhanced with procedural elements and varied weather conditions. Each map features distinct objectives and random anomalies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140620/extras/custom_1.png?t=1750842037\" /></div><br>Equip a wide array of ranged and melee weapons, each with upgrade options. Create and refine your loadout with unique modifiers, and utilize the crafting workshop to enhance your existing gear and craft new ones.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140620/extras/confort.png?t=1750842037\" /></div><br>Face off against a variety of distinct enemies, each with their own strengths and tactics. Adapt your strategies to survive their attacks.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140620/extras/cast_gif_1.gif?t=1750842037\" /></div>","developers":["Ascension Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140620/2b54f3124ccac4a6fbc85a3342663a5e74bb5b0e/header_alt_assets_3.jpg?t=1750842037","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257068398,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257068398/movie480.mp4?t=1730834790","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257068398/movie_max.mp4?t=1730834790"},"name":"C.A.S.T. - Early Access Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257068398/bf057c9a69be979ef1d7cf9c9c895063d991b19f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1730834790","webm":{"480":"http://video.akama